dedicated game servers allocated worldwide;. real-time netcode: authoritative server, client prediction, lag compensation and rollback;. parties, friends, voice and chat;. leaderboards: global, regional, friends and seasonal, for tens of millions of players;. progression, inventory and the in-game economy and store;. anti-cheat;.

