649
00:37:50.643 --> 00:37:55.785
Minors: age gates and parental controls (spend limits, chat restrictions, playtime);.

650
00:37:56.065 --> 00:38:02.998
DPDP Act consent for children's data (VERIFY rules);. platform policies (app store age ratings).

651
00:38:04.348 --> 00:38:10.940
Payments: receipt verification, fraud detection (stolen cards, chargeback abuse), and refund handling.

652
00:38:11.220 --> 00:38:12.863
Regulation (VERIFY):

653
00:38:13.143 --> 00:38:24.961
India's 2025 online gaming law and rules, which affect real-money games, promotion and registration of games;. rules on loot box disclosures in some countries;.

654
00:38:25.241 --> 00:38:30.127
GST treatment of in-app purchases;. consumer protection on virtual goods.

655
00:38:31.477 --> 00:38:37.194
Content moderation: chat filters, reporting, toxicity models, and bans for harassment.

656
00:38:37.474 --> 00:38:42.445
DDoS protection: game servers' UDP ports are DDoS targets.

657
00:38:42.725 --> 00:38:49.338
Use provider DDoS protection, relay networks that hide server IPs, and per-connection rate limits.

