665
00:39:15.634 --> 00:39:25.042
Launch readiness: load tests with bots simulating CCU, pre-scaled fleets, login queues, CDN pre-warming, kill switches and war rooms.

666
00:39:26.392 --> 00:39:35.309
Economy incidents: detect exploit spikes quickly;. disable offending items;. roll back via ledger reversals with player communication.

667
00:39:35.589 --> 00:39:42.437
Observability: tick-time histograms per server build;. packet loss and RTT by region and ISP;.

668
00:39:43.787 --> 00:39:51.745
queue time by skill band;. match start success rate;. crash rates by device;. purchase success;. leaderboard update lag.

